# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# favor-skills .gitignore — PROJECT-SPECIFIC rules only.
# Generic catch-all (OS cruft, editors, Python/Node caches, .env secrets) lives
# in the machine-wide global ignore: ~/.config/git/ignore
# Keep only what is specific to THIS repo here, so it travels with the repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Skill secret: SMTP app-password env sourced by the resend skill ─────────
.bump_env

# ── Skill runtime artifacts (PII: real attendee names/emails) ────────────────
# The resend/export pipelines write these to the working dir. Never commit —
# they contain real attendee data and live send progress.
attendees*.csv
sent_*.jsonl
sent_all.jsonl
bounced*.txt
recipient*.csv
*_bump_list*.csv
*_state.jsonl
*_state.jsonl.*.bak
*_run.log
*.bak

# ── Python caches (scripts run from inside this repo via the symlinked skill
#    dir, so caches land here — guard locally too, don't rely on global only) ─
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
